en:
"Hm? And what business have you lot here?
I've no interest in the people of the land, you know.{w}Or will you perhaps entertain me somehow?"{w}{p}"Well, no matter. I was bored myself;
this should do nicely to pass the time.{w}Now then, what manner of creature are you? Name yourselves."{w}{p}"...Honestly, this is what comes of lowborn rabble.
Perhaps naming myself first would be amusing in its own way?{w}I am Asunamuchi, the Heavenly Fiend. Mark it well."{w}

"Here in Miasuna there are heaps upon heaps of books
chronicling the history of this land in fine detail."{w}{p}"I have whiled away the time with them,
but of late even that has... grown a touch tiresome."{w}{p}"Come now, you lot.{w}Do something to entertain me.{w}I am bored, you hear?"{w}

"Ho? You lot have grown
rather formidable, haven't you?"{w}{p}"Since that day, nothing amusing has happened, you see.
I am bored.{w}Come, play with me and stave off my boredom."{w}

{0E}"You may have beaten me, but it's already too late...
Heh heh heh heh...{0F}
Urgh!"{w}

"...You have some skill."{w}{p}"However,
we mages, who stand at the apex of the hierarchy of knowledge,
have no cause to give way to fools."{w}{p}"Remember that... well."{w}
